e", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: You must be Adam.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hi Mr. Mitchell. Pleasure to meet you.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Likewise. How are you?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm good, thanks. Yourself?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Not bad. How was your trip? Was the traffic OK?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes, everything was fine, thanks.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Our HR team was quite content with your phone interview, congratulations.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Thanks.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Alright, why don't you tell me about yourself?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm a motivated, eager individual looking to work in a dynamic, fast-moving industry.", "id": 1}, {"time": "30400", "image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: That's good. We're looking for ambitious, dynamic copywriters with talent and drive. Tell me more about your educational background.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I graduated in communications from Boston University. I've taken many courses to help me perform well in this position.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: What work experience have you had?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I've worked with close-knit teams. I've also had the chance to develop relationships with a diverse range of clients.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Could you be more specific?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Sure. I've worked at the University newspaper and the local Boston Review, both with a group and independently. This has provided me with what I believe to be a solid foundation for this position.", "id": 2}, {"time": "68600", "image": "", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Are you more interested in a steady job with benefits and holiday entitlement or one that will allow you to advance quickly?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I don't want to hit a glass ceiling. I want to grow and move up the corporate ladder.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: Would you be able to relocate?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I am open to relocating.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: What are your annual salary requirements?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I need at least 65,000 a year.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Interviewer</span>: I'll keep that in mind. Thank you for coming in today. We'll be in touch.", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le13ob07re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}